      <section class="section"><div class="container">
      
      <div class="faq-cat">Booking &amp; Planning</div>
      <div class="faq-list">
      <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">How do I start planning a trip?<span class="icon"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></span></div><div class="faq-a"><p>Fill out our <a href="contact.html">contact form</a> or the customization form on any tour page. A travel designer will reply within 24 hours with initial ideas and a no-obligation quote. You can also book a free 30-minute video call.</p></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">Is there a minimum group size?<span class="icon"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></span></div><div class="faq-a"><p>No. We design journeys for solo travelers, couples, families, and small groups alike. Every trip is 100% private — you'll never be mixed with strangers.</p></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">How far in advance should I book?<span class="icon"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></span></div><div class="faq-a"><p>We recommend 2–3 months in advance for the best hotel availability and guide selection. However, we can arrange trips in as little as 2 weeks if needed. Peak seasons (April–May, September–October, Chinese holidays) book up faster.</p></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">Can I make changes after booking?<span class="icon"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></span></div><div class="faq-a"><p>Absolutely. Free itinerary revisions before final payment, and flexible on-trip adjustments whenever plans evolve. Your travel designer stays reachable throughout.</p></div></div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="faq-cat">Visas &amp; Documentation</div>
      <div class="faq-list">
      <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">Do I need a visa to visit China?<span class="icon"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></span></div><div class="faq-a"><p>Most nationalities require a tourist visa (L visa). We provide official invitation letters and all documentation you need for your application. Citizens of 50+ countries can now enjoy 15-day visa-free entry, and 72/144-hour transit visa exemptions are available for many routes.</p></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">How long does the visa process take?<span class="icon"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></span></div><div class="faq-a"><p>Typically 4–5 business days at a Chinese embassy or visa center. Some countries offer mail-in applications. We'll walk you through the exact process for your nationality.</p></div></div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="faq-cat">On Your Trip</div>
      <div class="faq-list">
      <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">Will I have a guide the entire time?<span class="icon"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></span></div><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes. A licensed, English-speaking guide accompanies you in each city. For multi-city trips, you'll have a different local specialist in each destination — all coordinated by your dedicated travel designer.</p></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">Is it safe to travel in China?<span class="icon"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></span></div><div class="faq-a"><p>China is one of the safest countries for international travelers. Violent crime is extremely rare. Petty theft is uncommon. Our 24/7 support line ensures help is always a call away.</p></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">What about internet access?<span class="icon"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></span></div><div class="faq-a"><p>Most international apps (Google, WhatsApp, Instagram, etc.) are blocked in China. We provide a pre-trip connectivity guide and can arrange a portable Wi-Fi device and VPN for you. All hotels have Wi-Fi.</p></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">Can you accommodate dietary restrictions?<span class="icon"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></span></div><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes — vegetarian, vegan, halal, kosher, gluten-free, and allergy-specific needs are all accommodated. Just tell us in advance; your guide will communicate with every restaurant.</p></div></div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="faq-cat">Payments &amp; Cancellation</div>
      <div class="faq-list">
      <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">How do I pay?<span class="icon"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></span></div><div class="faq-a"><p>We accept bank transfer, credit card (Visa/Mastercard), and PayPal. A 30% deposit secures your booking; the balance is due 30 days before departure. Full details are in your proposal.</p></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">What is your cancellation policy?<span class="icon"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></span></div><div class="faq-a"><p>Free cancellation up to 45 days before departure. 30–44 days: 30% fee. 15–29 days: 50% fee. Under 15 days: 80% fee. We strongly recommend travel insurance, which we can help arrange.</p></div></div>
      </div>
      
      </div></section>
